'' RUN: the precedence matrix (audit Phase 3 item 8; F-13, F-16, F-17, F-32, F-33): every
'' pair of binary operators as 'a op1 b op2 c', every unary-then-binary pair, and every
'' pair again inside '#if', with values that tell the groupings apart. Pairs fbc refuses
'' are left out. Output identical to fbc-modern's, at -O0 and -O2.
